flowchart TD
 A[Deterministic policy decision] --> B[Create immutable audit value]
 B --> C{Human review required?}
 C -- No --> D[NOT_REQUIRED]
 C -- Yes --> E[PENDING]
 E --> F{Reviewer disposition}
 F -- Approve --> G[Record APPROVED disposition]
 F -- Reject --> H[Record REJECTED disposition]
 G --> I[Original decision preserved]
 H --> I
 I --> J[No order mutation or external side effect]
